<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_826_2253.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freuendtlich</unclear> dienst, zuvor, lieben herrn unnd
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freuend</unclear>. Ir haben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sunder</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zwiuel</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mehrerntheil</unclear>
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuoerinnern</unclear>, das <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wegn</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Anthonj</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Stadlers</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">euwers</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schuld</unclear>-
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ners</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verstrickhung</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zwaij</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zinßbrieflin</unclear>, ain <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hundert</unclear>
<lb n="5"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">drissig</unclear> guldin, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">in</unclear> sich haltend. uff <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anrueffn</unclear> et-
<lb n="6"/>licher anderer seiner <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glaeubiger</unclear>, alhie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">arrestiert</unclear>, unnd
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verpotten</unclear> worden. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Wölche</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zinser</unclear>, und auch die ver-
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schribnen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">underpfand</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">under</unclear> <placeName resp="#ner">Sant <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Gallen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Oberkait</unclear></placeName>,
<lb n="9"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">also</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">euch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">am</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nechsten</unclear> gelegen. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Dieweil</unclear> nun die-
<lb n="10"/>selben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">niemands</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tugenlicher</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bequnemlicher</unclear>, dann
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Euch</unclear>, alls denen die der sachen am <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bassten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gesessen</unclear>, anzu-
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nemen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weren</unclear>, so ersuchen wir euch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freuendtlich</unclear>, Ir
<lb n="13"/>wöllen solliche brieflin, dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hauptguet</unclear> nach, an euch
<lb n="14"/>lösen, und uns dargegen das gelt überantwurten, da-
<lb n="15"/>mit wir unnsern <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">usstand</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dieweyl</unclear> wir von dem andern
<lb n="16"/>nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">volkumenlich</unclear> bezalt werden, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erlangen</unclear>, und volgends
<lb n="17"/>das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">überig</unclear>, den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">andern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glaeubigern</unclear>, so nach unnser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">stadt</unclear> recht,
<lb n="18"/>den hafft <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darbej</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gethn</unclear>, volgen lassen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mügen</unclear>. Das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sein</unclear>
<lb n="19"/>wir umb euch, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">neben</unclear> dem, das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">euch</unclear> daran <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nichtzit</unclear> abgeht,
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freuendtlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuebeschulden</unclear> genaigt. Datum den <origDate when="1563" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">10.t</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Sep</unclear>-
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">tembris</unclear> Anno d. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">63ten</unclear></origDate>.
<lb n="22"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-68" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Burgermaister</unclear> und rath,
<lb n="23"/>der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">stadt</unclear> Uberlingen</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_826_2254.jpg" n="2"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_826_2255.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_826_2256.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="24"/>Den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ernuösten</unclear> fürnemen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">N</unclear>. gemainen An=
<lb n="25"/><persName role="recipient" resp="#ner">thoni Stadlers</persName> creditorn unnd gleubigern
<lb n="26"/>zu <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Sant Gallen</placeName> unnsern lieben herrn unnd
<lb n="27"/>freünden.
</p>
